{"4133460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sol and the Endless Orbit", "steam_appid": 4133460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A not-quite-turn-based battle system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate strategic options while avoiding real-time attacks in a system inspired by Paper Mario and Undertale!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/db1dfdca286e5bb7ce2fa6da2449aa99.poster.avif?t=1765845532\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/db1dfdca286e5bb7ce2fa6da2449aa99.webm?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/db1dfdca286e5bb7ce2fa6da2449aa99.mp4?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equippable abilities for your character and your magic pencil</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Skills, swap them out anytime, and try different combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/57f1935be1b289f8a0c5ee9e3abdb23f.poster.avif?t=1765845532\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/57f1935be1b289f8a0c5ee9e3abdb23f.webm?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/57f1935be1b289f8a0c5ee9e3abdb23f.mp4?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An expressive moveset</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up speed, then twirl, dive, and flip to your heart's content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/bddb82858836e8203ab8d684bd9d550c.poster.avif?t=1765845532\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/bddb82858836e8203ab8d684bd9d550c.webm?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/bddb82858836e8203ab8d684bd9d550c.mp4?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control nearby objects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw your pencil to switch up the gameplay when you get tired of guiding this bozo around!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/e785bd860e7db8937d9d2f540e068610.poster.avif?t=1765845532\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/e785bd860e7db8937d9d2f540e068610.webm?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/e785bd860e7db8937d9d2f540e068610.mp4?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An involved story that spans multiple chapters! Stop the planet-destroying Lord Doomon, learn more about him, and uncover the secrets that lurk at the heart of the galaxy...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new planet to explore in each chapter. Mythical islands, futuristic cities, and more await!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple fun characters to follow you around, help you fight, and let you use cool abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free demo is available, and will expand to include all of Chapter 1 in 2026. The full game is planned to release sometime this decade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Note: Steam Achievements don't currently work on Mac. I'm still figuring out why, so apologies in the meantime.)</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A not-quite-turn-based battle system</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate strategic options while avoiding real-time attacks in a system inspired by Paper Mario and Undertale!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/db1dfdca286e5bb7ce2fa6da2449aa99.poster.avif?t=1765845532\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/db1dfdca286e5bb7ce2fa6da2449aa99.webm?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/db1dfdca286e5bb7ce2fa6da2449aa99.mp4?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equippable abilities for your character and your magic pencil</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Skills, swap them out anytime, and try different combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/57f1935be1b289f8a0c5ee9e3abdb23f.poster.avif?t=1765845532\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/57f1935be1b289f8a0c5ee9e3abdb23f.webm?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/57f1935be1b289f8a0c5ee9e3abdb23f.mp4?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An expressive moveset</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up speed, then twirl, dive, and flip to your heart's content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/bddb82858836e8203ab8d684bd9d550c.poster.avif?t=1765845532\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/bddb82858836e8203ab8d684bd9d550c.webm?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/bddb82858836e8203ab8d684bd9d550c.mp4?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control nearby objects</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw your pencil to switch up the gameplay when you get tired of guiding this bozo around!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/e785bd860e7db8937d9d2f540e068610.poster.avif?t=1765845532\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/e785bd860e7db8937d9d2f540e068610.webm?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/extras/e785bd860e7db8937d9d2f540e068610.mp4?t=1765845532\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An involved story that spans multiple chapters! Stop the planet-destroying Lord Doomon, learn more about him, and uncover the secrets that lurk at the heart of the galaxy...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new planet to explore in each chapter. Mythical islands, futuristic cities, and more await!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple fun characters to follow you around, help you fight, and let you use cool abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free demo is available, and will expand to include all of Chapter 1 in 2026. The full game is planned to release sometime this decade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Note: Steam Achievements don't currently work on Mac. I'm still figuring out why, so apologies in the meantime.)</p>", "short_description": "A story-rich, not-quite-turn-based hybrid of RPG strategy and real-time platforming. Secure the future of the galaxy's vibrant settings and whimsical inhabitants... or uncover the secrets at the center of everything, and draw a different path.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/fa99781b1822a0c967f0de8923c8c0b7dd00ad63/header.jpg?t=1765845532", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/22decaa18b5ccec354445ba7f3394fb006818b29/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765845532", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4133460/22decaa18b5ccec354445ba7f3394fb006818b29/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765845532", "website": "https://solandtheendlessorbit.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 64 MB+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15+<br></li>